cl. 1. P. (Dhātup. iii, 16) र॑दति (rarely Ā. ˚ते; Ved. Impv. रत्सि; pf. ररा॑द, RV.; aor. अरादीत् or अरदीत् Gr.; fut. रदिता, ˚दिष्यति, ib.),
to scratch, scrape, gnaw, bite, rend, dig, break, split, divide, RV.; AV.; Suśr.;
to cut, open (a road or path), RV.;
to lead (a river) into a channel, ib.;
to convey to, bestow on, give, dispense, RV.; AV.; Br.
